<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova 28-day T-bills steady, 91-, 182-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day T-bills steady, 91-, 182-day down.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was 22.54 percent at an auction on Tuesday, unchanged from the previous auction on May 6, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 22.90 percent from 24.24 percent from on May 6. The yield on 182-day T-bills fell to 25.04 percent from 28.65 percent on April 22.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    May 13	     May 6</p>
<p> Issue volume		   2.00 million lei     2.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 4.30 million	   3.54 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    2.00 million	   2.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    22.54 pct	  22.54 pct</p>
<p> Price			    98.3 pct	   98.3 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  98.3-98.6 pct    98.3-98.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 June 12, 1997    June 5, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 91-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    May 13	     May 6</p>
<p> Issue volume		   17 million lei	 16.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 34.28 million	  37.74 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    17.00 million	  16.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    22.90		24.24 pct</p>
<p> Price			    94.6 pct	   94.3 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  94.6-96.0 pct    94.3-94.7 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Aug 14, 1997     Aug 7, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the 182-day paper auction:</p>
<p>				    May 13	     April 22</p>
<p> Issue volume		   6.00 million lei     4.00 million lei</p>
<p> Denominations		  1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 12.14 million	  8.97 million</p>
<p> Volume sold		    6.00 million	   4.00 million</p>
<p> Yield			    25.04 pct	  28.65 pct</p>
<p> Price			    88.9 pct	   87.5 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  88.9-89.3 pct    87.5-88.5 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Nov 13, 1997     Oct 23, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
